  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large pressure cooker or Dutch oven over medium heat.",
    "Add the chorizo and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the onion and garlic and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the red bell pepper and cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Add the chicken broth, red wine, tomato paste, salt, and pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Add the chestnuts and stir to coat with the sauce.",
    "Close the pressure cooker or cover the Dutch oven with a lid and cook for 15 minutes.",
    "Add the sauteed kale and cook for an additional 5 minutes.",
    "Taste and adjust the seasoning as needed.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy!",
    "Leftovers can be refrigerated for up to 3 days or frozen for up to 2 months."
